# Documentation

Do not write documentation during the main task. The stop hook (`.cursor/hooks/ensure-docs.py`) sends one Documancer follow-up when a turn changes product behavior.

- Code behavior (APIs, services, contracts, configuration, MCP): `.userdocs/technical.json` and `.userdocs/technical.html`
- App behavior (UI, routes, user-visible flow): `.userdocs/user-guide.json` and `.userdocs/user-guide.html`

That follow-up reads `.cursor/skills/documancer/SKILL.md`, edits the JSON and HTML named above, and stops when the diff did not change behavior. Leave every other file under `.roots/docs/` and `.userdocs/` unchanged unless the user asks to edit it.
